# appleeventsd

> Handles cross-application interaction in macOS. It is the underlying basis of AppleScript.
> Note: It should not be invoked manually.
> More information: <https://keith.github.io/xcode-man-pages/appleeventsd.8.html>.

- Start the daemon:

`appleeventsd`
